<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Tool Calling Functions</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix specifies the callable tools used by the agent in a Pythonic format. Each block presents the function signature, purpose, input arguments, and expected return. All tools return a list of <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">track_id</span> strings (up to <span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">topk</span>), and are designed to be composed in sequence within the retrieval–reranking pipeline.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_python ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
